"""AFE201612S2R2MBT - 2.2 uH 20 % molded power inductor, 0806 (2.0 x 1.6 x 1.2 mm). Bare part.

Datasheet: Magnetsyc (metal-lions) AFE2016 series, Rev.01 (LCSC C41347750).

Electrical properties (page 3 table, AFE201612S2R2MBT row; notes page 4): L0 2.2 uH +-20 %
at 0 A, 1 MHz; Rdc 77 mOhm typ / 90 mOhm max; heat-rating current Irms 3.3 A typ / 2.9 A
(40 C rise, note 3); saturation current Isat 3.1 A typ / 2.7 A (L0 drop of about 30 %,
note 4). Rated current is the lower of Isat and Irms (note 7). Operating temperature -40 to
+125 C including self-heating (page 1; note 6).

Dimensions (page 1): 2.0 +- 0.2 x 1.6 +- 0.2 mm, 1.20 mm max height.
"""

load("@stdlib/units.zen", "Current", "Inductance", "Resistance")
load("@stdlib/utils.zen", "format_value")

P1 = io(Net)
P2 = io(Net)

# Page 3: the table gives a typical and a "Max" column; the "Max" values are the lower ones
# (Irms 2.9 A, Isat 2.7 A) and are used here as the rated current.
inductance = Inductance("2.2uH 20%")
isat = Current("2.7A")
dcr = Resistance("90mOhm")

Component(
    name="AFE201612S2R2MBT",
    prefix="L",
    symbol=Symbol(library="AFE201612S2R2MBT.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("IND-SMD_L2.0-W1.6-B.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="AFE201612S2R2MBT", manufacturer="Magnetsyc"),
    pins={"1": P1, "2": P2},
    properties={
        "value": format_value(inductance, isat),
        "inductance": inductance,
        "current": isat,
        "dcr": dcr,
    },
    type="inductor",
)
